ions":[{"name":"exclamation","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"gnu_head","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"sorena","count":3,"users":["U06BRP8VD","UAZ33BKV2","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"37pK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ec79f3a-5300-4822-b938-fdf2c4650356","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あれ、GNU本家プロダクトだっけ?","ts":"1635399965.161300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZzvW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7effc1b8-9041-42ee-8e67-957ecf88ce43","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"gnuではめずらしくグラフィック系ユーティリテかつ多目的多用途(かな?)だからw?","ts":"1635399949.160900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MmBx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2e927d9-ddaf-451a-94c4-716f557196e5","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003c#C01A6GCLF3N|lang-c\u003e でもなぜか私は gnuplot を推すマンになってる","ts":"1635399848.160000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TVPL7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c17ed04f-0f0e-48f3-82d4-fc2bf3b9b42f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"（plotってプロット図のことか）","ts":"1635399846.159800","thread_ts":"1635399846.159800","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I38"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5eb54e2c-49d3-4b11-8d60-d3942e626f42","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/sysstat/sysstat/\u003e これ良さそうだなと思いました","ts":"1635399811.159000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S1q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"70c0b209-3d82-41dd-a9c0-f5a0bdfda48e","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"plot するだけなら、gnuplot とかあるし","ts":"1635399802.158900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ltt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c431656a-4a36-463d-9128-2d7dbadef982","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、その気持ちなどはわかりますが...w","ts":"1635399777.158500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tbU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8946ab95-c99c-44cf-b957-09ecea4facee","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; それが1コマンドにまとまってる必要はあまりない気がする\nコマンドを分けるってことですか？\nそれはそれでインストールの手間がかかって面倒かなって思いました","ts":"1635399709.158000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k3=nJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0bc56cc-a941-4933-a0db-771fe81941a5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"場合によるけど、それが1コマンドにまとまってる必要はあまりない気がする(取得と同時に画面や画像やHTMLに出しつづける動作をさせるのでなければ)","ts":"1635399622.157100","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1635399645.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5s/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5dac315c-fa38-438e-a613-c8ad4ed60c43","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど\n自分のイメージですが、こんな使い方ができたら良いなって考えています\n```# 終了するまで使用率をprof.outに書き出す\ncli watch --cpu --mem --output=prof.out $pid\n\n# 記録した中身を画像として書き出す\ncli output --format=png prof.out out.png```","ts":"1635399532.156300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Ty"}]},{"client_msg_id":"034efd97-88c7-4fff-b4cd-94fa70f45708","type":"message","user":"U018TJJT347","text":"使ったことないですが\n\u003chttps://github.com/gh0st42/procrec|https://github.com/gh0st42/procrec\u003e\nとかその alternatives に載ってるやつで出来そうではありますね","ts":"1635399470.155400","thread_ts":"1635399470.155400","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"gh0st42/procrec","id":1,"title":"gh0st42/procrec","text":"A cpu and memory usage recorder written in rust","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"6","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Rust","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gzd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55800b10-c9e3-489d-9e3e-17ac1b96441c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"データログとして記録する方法と、それをグラフにする方法とは基本的に分けられる。\n\nまぁ、いまどきはまとめてやるのあってもおかしくないけど。","ts":"1635397248.150600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jUC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3bcdd228-ff79-4599-ae64-95bab413a07b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"考え方を分けるべきだと思うよ。","ts":"1635397219.150000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jVfrs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a01f616a-0225-4e9c-9d85-42ff97991bdc","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"イメージ見るにこれ継続してメトリクス取らないと出せないやつなのでCLIかと言われるとどうなんって感じ","ts":"1635393589.149000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"59iK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f124ed3-ede4-47e0-8da2-ab8885ca5574","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"確かにpprofが違うならこれも違いそう","ts":"1635391801.148100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r4FjC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ecaa6e2-de6e-4892-a3d4-849aa2d0112b","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"perf調べてみたけど、すごくpprofっぽい","ts":"1635391724.147700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zAp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a5984c2-b42f-4ea6-b480-8a0dd2b44b8b","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```--output-format \"png\" --output text | base64 --decode \u0026gt; test.png```","ts":"1635391684.147300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kYGI9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"308a9de4-b921-4fb4-94f1-c19df2884cfd","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"イメージとしてはまさにこれです","ts":"1635391666